With the vault inside the repo and a null `path`, the project tier root is the vault itself:
`--tier project` creates nothing and prints the vault root alone; `ls` shows the vault untouched.

-- fixtures/cwd/.booping --
project_name: probe
vault_path: ./vault
latest_migration: 9999
-- fixtures/cwd/vault/sprints.md --
sprints
-- cmd --
booping specs init --tier project
ls vault
-- exit --
0
-- stdout --
{CWD}/vault
sprints.md
-- stderr --
